sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Entra / Okta
    participant R as waltid-scim-server
    participant L as waltid-scim engine
    participant S as Host store
    participant H as Lifecycle listener
    C->>R: PATCH /Users/{id}
    R->>L: request + ScimRequestContext
    Note over L: normalise vendor quirks
    L->>S: get(ctx, User, id)
    S-->>L: document + version v1
    Note over L: If-Match sent and stale? → 412
    Note over L: apply ops on a copy<br/>enforce mutability, diff
    alt nothing changed
        L-->>R: 200 / 204, no event
    else changed
        L->>S: replace(newDoc, expected = v1)
        opt conflict, no If-Match
            L->>S: reload, re-apply, retry (max 3)
        end
        S-->>L: committed, version v2
        L-->>R: 200 + resource, ETag W/"v2"
        L-)H: onCommitted(event)
    end
    R-->>C: response
